sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant UI as Interface: Causes table
    participant CC as Causes Controller
    participant CA as SQL table: causes

    Admin->>UI: Click Delete/Deactivate on a cause
    UI->>CC: Request cause deactivation
    CC->>CA: Update cause set is_active = false
    CA-->>CC: Update result
    CC-->>UI: Deactivation success
    UI->>CC: Refresh causes list
    CC->>CA: Read visible causes
    CA-->>CC: Cause rows
    CC-->>UI: Refreshed list
    UI-->>Admin: Cause no longer appears in active list

    alt Cause not found or update error
        CC-->>UI: Error response
        UI-->>Admin: Show error and keep list unchanged
    else Reactivate needed later
        Admin->>UI: Include inactive causes and click Activate
        UI->>CC: Request cause activation
        CC->>CA: Update cause set is_active = true
        CA-->>CC: Update result
        CC-->>UI: Activation success
        UI-->>Admin: Cause appears as active again
    end
